These unchanged schema fixtures were downloaded from the official CycloneDX
specification repository, tag 1.6, during the 2026-10-19 validation.
The per-file source URLs and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in manifest.json.
https://github.com/CycloneDX/specification/tree/1.6/schema
