The JSF schema retains its original attribution to Anders Rundgren and the
OpenKeyStore project in its $comment field.

Schema tests register every reference locally and reject any undeclared
reference instead of downloading it. The writer output is validated directly
as JSON bytes, without round-tripping through a CycloneDX struct.
